      core:'Existence precedes essence — humans first exist and then define themselves through choices. There is no pre-given human nature or cosmic purpose. We are condemned to be free, creating profound anxiety (Angst). Authentic existence means accepting this freedom and its responsibility.',
      reacted:'Against the Enlightenment view that reason provides objective foundations for meaning. Against Hegel\'s historical determinism. Against religious accounts that give life pre-given purpose.',
